# Two Rooms of Refuge each choose their own color as each enters (CR 614.1c, 607.2d): the first chose red on turn one, the
# second blue on turn three, and each adds its own color. The second enters tapped as well. (That a Room makes no other
# color is the sibling scenario's check.)

